+# Version Numbering Scheme
+
+Nothing is currently recorded in this project about a version numbering scheme. The repository tags releases like `v1.12.0` (see `version.go` and `CHANGELOG.md`), but no document, ADR, or policy in this project states what rule (e.g. Semantic Versioning or otherwise) governs how those numbers are chosen or incremented.
